# NOTE: the generated files in assets/ are deliberately NOT ignored.
# assets/logo-header-*.png and assets/icon-*.png ship in the npm tarball, and
# assets/logo-readme-*.png is what the README loads over raw.githubusercontent —
# ignoring them would break the package icon and the README images. They are
# reproducible with `node scripts/make-assets.mjs`, but they must be committed.
